    "text": "By Jordan Vallender ,\n1 hours ago BRYAN, Texas (KBTX) - Third Floor Cantina is set to open its doors with a new name and management. Third Floor Cantina is a bar in Downtown Bryan, and it opened on New Year’s Day 2020 under the management of Dustin Batson. However, a few months later, the pandemic started, and the business closed its doors. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
